lips, J.J. Cale y su estilo «laid-back», Gram Parsons, Emmylou Harris, Roger McGuinn, Jackson Browne (Late For The Sky) y, sobre todo, Tom Waits, discípulo de Beefheart y cronista de marginados (Swordfishtrombones, Rain Dogs). Excéntricos como Todd Rundgren y Annette Peacock; en Gran Bretaña, Peter Hammill, Anthony Moore, Richard Thompson, Robert Calvert, John Cale, Kevin Coyne, Elton John y los ex Beatles. El realismo de Bruce Springsteen, verdadero heredero de Woody Guthrie y del blues, y la escuela italiana de cantautores (De André, Guccini, Battisti, Sorrenti).","color":"#a3e635","family":"Folk y cantautores","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#songwriters-70s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":262526972443195,"artist":"Fabrizio De Andre","artist_id":235430442321682,"title":"Tutti Morimmo A Stento","year":1968,"ess":0,"yt":"klHBPF8iqbA","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Cantautores de los setenta","scene_id":98497937254844,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#songwriters-70s","chapters":["Sección 4.3"],"pages":[[1,87,null]]}],"mentions":[],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":118288497113756,"type":"album","name":"Vol. 1°","list_id":247741857512790,"list":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Italian Music","src":"musthear","rank":42,"year":1967,"note":null,"yt":"CteW_zd1IDs","scaruffi":null},{"id":118288497113756,"type":"album","name":"Vol. 1°","list_id":275689133180045,"list":"RYM Top — Singer-Songwriter — Canzone d'autore","src":"musthear","rank":36,"year":1967,"note":null,"yt":"CteW_zd1IDs","scaruffi":null},{"id":262526972443195,"type":"album","name":"Tutti morimmo a stento","list_id":94905110718967,"list":"RYM Top — Folk","src":"musthear","rank":186,"year":1968,"note":null,"yt":"aXDw3pGYxGI","scaruffi":null},{"id":262526972443195,"type":"album","name":"Tutti morimmo a stento","list_id":87310548737747,"list":"R